Package: deskdora
Version: 3.7.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: DeskDora Contributors
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-venv, python3-gi, python3-pyatspi, at-spi2-core, gir1.2-atspi-2.0, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, gir1.2-keybinder-3.0, xdotool, scrot, xclip, xdg-utils
Description: Local-first desktop agent for Linux (Ubuntu/GNOME): accessibility-tree grounding, Ollama-powered planning with optional cloud planners via your own API key, a mandatory-confirmation safety layer, and a complete audit log of every action.
